message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying article (preferred-citation) and/or this software entry."
title: "LabSeatReservation"
abstract: >-
  LabSeatReservation: a web-based laboratory seat reservation and
  usage-accounting platform for university teaching laboratories. It manages
  laboratory rooms, workstation layout modelling (seat / door / window
  primitives), reservation requests and approvals, monthly rental accounting,
  occupancy history with two-stage conflict detection, role-based access
  control and operation auditing.
